      "title": "🔓 [Outside Online] Your Heavy Hiking Pack Is Destroying Your Feet—Here’s What the Latest Science Says",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hiking-pack-study.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Fhealth%2Ftraining-performance%2Fheavy-backpack-foot-injuries-study%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hiking-pack-study.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Fhealth%2Ftraining-performance%2Fheavy-backpack-foot-injuries-study%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hiking-pack-study.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Fhealth%2Ftraining-performance%2Fheavy-backpack-foot-injuries-study%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hiking-pack-study.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.outsideonline.com%2Fhealth%2Ftraining-performance%2Fheavy-backpack-foot-injuries-study%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Your Heavy Hiking Pack Is Destroying Your Feet—Here’s What the Latest Science Says\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hiking-pack-study.jpg?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>A new study finds that carrying more than ten percent of your body weight in your pack increases plantar pressure, causing foot injuries.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/health/training-performance/heavy-backpack-foot-injuries-study/\">Your Heavy Hiking Pack Is Destroying Your Feet—Here’s What the Latest Science Says</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
